  "description": {
    "raw": "While protected by fastidiousness, your person and your equipment stay clean and dry. Dust and moisture slough off immediately; even when you are completely soiled, your appearance reverts to a pristine state over the course of 1 minute. While this spell offers no protection against most attacks, staying constantly sanitary grants you a +2 circumstance bonus on Fortitude saving throws against inhaled and ingested diseases.\n\nMembers of the Prophet of Kalistrade prestige class can cast this spell, even though it is not a divination or enchantment.",
    "search_text": "\"while protected by fastidiousness, your person and your equipment stay clean and dry. dust and moisture slough off immediately; even when you are completely soiled, your appearance reverts to a pristine state over the course of 1 minute. while this spell offers no protection against most attacks, staying constantly sanitary grants you a +2 circumstance bonus on fortitude saving throws against inhaled and ingested diseases.\\n\\nmembers of the prophet of kalistrade prestige class can cast this spell, even though it is not a divination or enchantment.\"",
